---
layout: default
pageClass: introduction
keywords:
- director of engineering
- developer
- open source
- botany
permalink: /
---

<section class="intro-welcome container-large grid">
	<div class="intro-welcome-content col-4">
		<h1>Hey there!</h1>
		<p>
			I'm Moritz, an engineering leader based in Berlin, with over 15 years of experience in software development. 
			I currently lead Forward Deployed Engineering globally at 
			<a class="with-icon" href="https://parloa.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
				<img src="/assets/img/parloa.webp" width="30" height="30" alt="Parloa Logo" aria-hidden="true"> 
				<strong>Parloa</strong>
			</a>.
		</p>
		<p>
			I work where engineering, product, and customer delivery overlap. 
			My teams fill product gaps when needed, build integrations and infrastructure, 
			and design new capabilities with customers before they make it onto the roadmap.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="intro-welcome-photo col-2">
		<div class="intro-welcome-photo-mask">
			{%
				render blob-photo,
				photoUrl: "moritz-mountains.webp",
				photoTitle: "Selfie of Moritz standing in the Slovenian Alps",
				photoAlt: "Selfie of Moritz standing in the Slovenian Alps",
				offsetY: "-60"
			%}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<div class="intro-content container-large grid">
	<section class="col-3">
		<header>
			<h2>Projects</h2>
			<a href="{{ socialnetworks.github.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="chip">See all</a>
		</header>
		<p>
			I really enjoy working on and building open source side projects. I mainly work on web applications and developer tools.
		</p>
		<ul class="content-list-projects">
			{% for project in projects %}
			<li class="project-{{ project.name }}" data-project="{{ project.name }}">
				<a href="{{ project.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="box">
					<span class="project-title">
						{% if project.img %}
							<img src="{{ project.img }}" width="30" height="30" alt="Logo of {{ project.title }}">
						{% endif %}
						{% if project.icon %}
							<svg><use xlink:href="{{ project.icon }}"></use></svg>
						{% endif %}
						{{ project.title }}
					</span>
					<p>{{ project.description }}</p>
				</a>
			</li>
			{% endfor %}
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="col-3">
		<header>
			<h2>Writing</h2>
		</header>
		<p>
			I used to write a bit about JavaScript engineering, but haven't gotten to it in a while. In case you want to know what my thoughts were back then, check these articles out:
		</p>
		<ul class="content-list-articles">
			{% for post in collections.posts limit:5 %}
			{% assign data = post.data %}
			<li>
				<span>{{ post.date | date: "year" }}</span>
				{% if data.external %}
				<a href="{{ data.external.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
				{% else %}
				<a href="{{ post.url }}">
				{% endif %}
					{{ data.title }}
					{% if data.external %}
					<svg><use xlink:href="#new-window"></use></svg>
					{% endif %}
				</a>
			</li>
			{% endfor %}
		</ul>
	</section>
</div>
